      "cooked": "<p>This is from a series of photos taken of Lake Erie, which gets waves that are just insane. &nbsp;I saw it and immediately thought of Ocean's Hungry Grasp.</p><p>Perhaps the spirits aren't all gone from our world. &nbsp;Lake Erie is notoriously harsh on traffic, with shifting sandbars and crazy wave patterns.</p><p><span alt=\"Lake Erie's Hungry Grasp?\" class=\"broken-image\" title=\"This image is broken\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-unlink svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#unlink\"></use></svg></span></p>",
